Scenario: View fls warning only
	Testing the ability to create an account with a partner in provisioning before sending an existing message with the same partner but false FLS in Dossiera and viewing the project partner warning in the form of a zendesk ticket

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code   | ZENKOR                        | |
	| Name   | Zenkor - ${staticCompanyName} | |
	| Status | Active                        | |
	| Tier   | T4                            | |
